# Per-release changelog scratch file, consumed and deleted by publishReleaseToGit - never
# committed, so a leftover/forgotten one never pollutes `git status` between releases.
RELEASE_NOTES.md

# Google Drive desktop sync writes its upload staging files here (unrelated to this repo) -
# a release build once swept thousands of these into a commit before this exclusion existed.
.tmp.driveupload/
